{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>現年21歲歌手炎明熹（Gigi）已出道5年，繼日前宣布將推出首張個人專輯《Still,the Lightness?》後，更定於下月6日舉行發布會，當天活動全場均為企位，門票組合價為1,280元，當中包括《Still, the Lightness?》專輯及入場門票一張，粉絲更有機會於活動中，與Gigi⁠一對一互動及玩遊戲，歌迷都相當踴躍，門票火速售罄。</p><p>on.cc東網</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T14:34:51.122472+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":184,"images":0,"source":"東網 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T13:32:44+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-28T11:51:39.370386+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T14:28:12.232398+00:00","content_hash":"2fa562e575ddf0f923c4a1caed697132c9c268fda0fac8a7f9b294f825a804aa","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-11-27T14:34:51.122472+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}